# Keep build context to the actual app. In particular .git must be excluded:
# the Dockerfile's `COPY ./*` flattens directory contents into the app root,
# and a copied .git/description file makes Shiny's loadSupport() fail with
# "Unnamed repository ... is malformed" -> the app exits during initialization.
.git
.gitignore
.Rproj.user
.Rhistory
.RData
.DS_Store
tests
*.psd
*.Rproj
Screenshot*.png
